# autonomous-prototyper: environment variables
#
# Copy to .env and fill in. Load with: `set -a; . ./.env; set +a`.
#
# ONE Telegram bot — the ideator is the only human-facing agent. You
# settle the hunt direction with it, then approve or reject the ideas it
# surfaces. The pessimist and prototyper run headless; their work reaches
# you through the ideator.
#
# Create the bot via @BotFather and paste its token below. Find your chat
# id with @userinfobot. `teamctl bot setup` can fill these in for you
# interactively.

# ─── Ideator bot (settle the direction, then approve/reject ideas) ───────────
TEAMCTL_TG_IDEATOR_TOKEN="123456:AAH-ideator-bot-token"
TEAMCTL_TG_IDEATOR_CHATS="123456789"
